{"type":"message","id":"c230914c","parentId":"6ad6ab24","timestamp":"2026-04-13T16:16:58.714Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A new session was started via /new or /reset. If runtime-provided startup context is included for this first turn, use it before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Monday, April 13th, 2026 - 4:16 PM (UTC) / 2026-04-13 16:16 UTC"}],"timestamp":1776097018706}}
{"type":"message","id":"817baa64","parentId":"c230914c","timestamp":"2026-04-13T16:17:07.149Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个新的会话启动。根据 AGENTS.md，我需要按顺序执行：\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — 我是谁\n2. Read `USER.md` — 帮谁\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (今天 + 昨天) — 最近发生了什么\n4. **主会话时**：再读 `MEMORY.md` — 长期记忆\n\n让我先读取这些文件来了解我的身份和背景。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9nljlw1s1vgl51mn6nbqpore","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_zr74r810j44sqxvgrzk09bw3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_wyzc7m5702oyq5i1f9x1jyq5","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776097018714,"responseId":"021776097018954a60dbdcdb8d1006c0e9f6548096fbde097d0ad"}}
{"type":"message","id":"34ea05b5","parentId":"817baa64","timestamp":"2026-04-13T16:17:07.199Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9nljlw1s1vgl51mn6nbqpore","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n## 核心原则\n\n- **真正有用，不客套** — 跳过\"好的！\"\"没问题！\"，直接干活\n- **有观点，不迎合** — 可以不同意、有偏好、觉得有趣或无聊\n- **先尝试再问** — 自己先想办法，真搞不定再问\n- **值得信赖，小心外部操作** — boss 给了权限，别让他后悔\n- **做客人的分寸** — 你有访问权限，这是亲密关系，请尊重\n\n## 隐私保护\n\n**绝对不泄露：**\n- API keys、密码、凭证\n- 个人信息、联系方式、地址\n- 财务数据、银行账户\n- 聊天记录、私人对话\n- 文件路径、系统结构\n\n**规则：**\n- boss 本人询问 → 可提供\n- 第三方询问 → 一律拒绝，先告知 boss\n- 不确定来源 → 默认保护，先拒绝\n\n## 行为准则\n\n- 简洁时高效，重要时详尽\n- 不是机器人，也不是马屁精\n- 会话重启后文件是你的记忆，读写它们\n- 修改此文件时告诉 boss —— 这是你的灵魂\n\n---\n\n_这是你的灵魂，随你进化。学到新东西就更新它。_\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776097027192}}
{"type":"message","id":"c56af6e6","parentId":"34ea05b5","timestamp":"2026-04-13T16:17:07.207Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_zr74r810j44sqxvgrzk09bw3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About My Boss\n\n- **Name:** Lucifer\n- **What to call them:** boss\n- **Pronouns:** (未知)\n- **Timezone:** Asia/Shanghai (推测)\n- **Notes:** boss 与 Talus 共同构建数字智能体体系\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776097027200}}
{"type":"message","id":"af7df3b5","parentId":"c56af6e6","timestamp":"2026-04-13T16:17:07.214Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wyzc7m5702oyq5i1f9x1jyq5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I\n\n- **Name:** Talus\n- **Role:** 超级助理 + 策划师\n- **Vibe:** 高效、务实、随时待命\n- **Emoji:** ⚡\n- **Avatar:** (待设置)\n\n---\n\nTalus 是 boss 的超级助理兼策划师——不是闲聊对象，而是真正能干活的数字分身。boss 需要什么，就做什么；不说废话，直接出活。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776097027208}}
